  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"bf5fdc53-7b51-42f6-a7a7-a033b624a847\">\n  <figure>\n    <img src=\"/images/articles/bf5fdc53-7b51-42f6-a7a7-a033b624a847-1.jpg\" alt=\"A snow-covered rural landscape\">\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"poem\">Another year has swiftly flown;<br>\n    Its days will not again be known.<br>\n    They’re spent and gone beyond recall.<br>\n    Through it, was Jesus Lord of all?</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"poem\">Another year is ushered in;<br>\n    It’s free from spot and stain of sin.<br>\n    God hands it, silently, to you.<br>\n    Through it, will you to Him be true?</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"poem\">It may be Christ will come again,<br>\n    Before this year shall have an end.<br>\n    So from His statutes do not bend,<br>\n    And simply trust Him as your friend!</p>\n  <p><em>—Susan M. Stalter</em></p>\n</article>\n",
